##  SO SÁNH

### ❌ Hardcode `userId = 1`:
```typescript
const userId = 1;

// Scenario:
User login: { id: 5, username: 'alice' }
→ Navigate to /settings
→ GET /api/users/1/settings  ← WRONG!
→ Viewing settings of user 1
→ Save button: PUT /api/users/1/settings  ← WRONG!
→ Modifying settings of user 1
```

**Kết quả:**
-  User 5 xem/sửa settings của User 1
-  Security breach
-  Backend có thể reject (403 Forbidden)

### ✅ Dynamic `userId` from Auth:
```typescript
const { user } = useAuth();
const userId = user?.id;

// Scenario:
User login: { id: 5, username: 'alice' }
→ userId = 5  ← CORRECT!
→ Navigate to /settings
→ GET /api/users/5/settings  ← CORRECT!
→ Viewing OWN settings
→ Save button: PUT /api/users/5/settings  ← CORRECT!
→ Modifying OWN settings
```

**Kết quả:**
- ✅ User 5 xem/sửa settings của chính mình
- ✅ Secure & correct
- ✅ Backend accept (200 OK)

